{"id":"n62415-1-22","stage":1,"title":"자유 · 自由","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62415-1-22-1","ko":"기숙사 생활은 괜찮아?","zh":"宿舍生活还习惯吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기숙사","meaning":"宿舍","explanation":"기숙사：宿舍。","readings":[{"term":"기숙사","audio":"/audio/05e9ed6b1689b2f78ab6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18273","senseId":"1","lemma":"기숙사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기숙사","audio":"/audio/05e9ed6b1689b2f78ab6.mp3"}},{"text":"생활은","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"3","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생활은","audio":"/audio/5b0805835447f70c6e55.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아?","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"05e9ed6b1689b2f7","term":"기숙사","zh":"宿舍","audio":"/audio/05e9ed6b1689b2f78ab6.mp3","entryId":"18273","definition":"学校或公司提供给学生或员工的可以一起睡觉、用餐的设施。","pronunciation":["기숙싸"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"作为某组织的一员进行活动。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e831088d741e56b9a8a5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62415-1-22-2","ko":"아무래도 단체 생활을 해야 하니까 혼자 살 때보다는 자유가 없지.","zh":"毕竟要集体生活，所以没有独自居住时那么自由。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是。","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}},{"text":"단체","meaning":"团体，集体，团伙","explanation":"단체：团体，集体，团伙。","readings":[{"term":"단체","audio":"/audio/e1d6f0acf31a08bd63d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64532","senseId":"1","lemma":"단체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단체","audio":"/audio/e1d6f0acf31a08bd63d7.mp3"}},{"text":"생활을","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"3","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생활을","audio":"/audio/53c17a022fee2e44e967.mp3"}},{"text":"해야","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야","audio":"/audio/c8f942c39d369acda96c.mp3"}},{"text":"하니까","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니까","audio":"/audio/c5687c04fe55d30da1c1.mp3"}},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}},{"text":"살","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}},{"text":"때보다는","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；보다：比较的基准：“比……”；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때보다는","audio":"/audio/24c736669dadacebaa9a.mp3"}},{"text":"자유가","meaning":"自由","explanation":"자유：自由；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자유","audio":"/audio/9a0c92b2f4c9f8a125ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62415","senseId":"1","lemma":"자유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자유가","audio":"/audio/6b3dbacff2388b1e6431.mp3"}},{"text":"없지.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없지","audio":"/audio/1d76091ae1eea6a08772.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f5dbee1c946c5e6b","term":"아무래도","zh":"到底，还是","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3","entryId":"71330","definition":"不管怎么想；或指不管怎么做。","pronunciation":["아ː무래도"]},{"id":"e1d6f0acf31a08bd","term":"단체","zh":"团体，集体，团伙","audio":"/audio/e1d6f0acf31a08bd63d7.mp3","entryId":"64532","definition":"为了实现共同目的而聚集到一起的人们的组织。","pronunciation":["단체"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"作为某组织的一员进行活动。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"9a0c92b2f4c9f8a1","term":"자유","zh":"自由","audio":"/audio/9a0c92b2f4c9f8a125ec.mp3","entryId":"62415","definition":"不受某物牵制或约束，可以按照自己的想法和意志做的状态。","pronunciation":["자유"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/87a9487cb84cc70935ce.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.815,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62415","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":58,"sequenceScore":2.6417,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["毕竟要集体生活，所以没有独自居住时那么自由。","宿舍生活还习惯吗？","周末我有安排，好像没办法见你了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["宿舍生活还习惯吗？","周末我有安排，好像没办法见你了？","毕竟要集体生活，所以没有独自居住时那么自由。"],"answer":2}]}
